<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsubsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S2.SS1.SSS1.Px1" title="In 2.1.1 What is Explicit Consent? The Default Opt-in Setting ‣ 2.1 Data Collection and Retention Policies ‣ 2 What Data is Affected? ‣ Position: Privacy is not just memorization!" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Thumbs up or down? You just consented to 10 years of data retention, even as a paid user!</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S2.SS1.SSS1.Px2" title="In 2.1.1 What is Explicit Consent? The Default Opt-in Setting ‣ 2.1 Data Collection and Retention Policies ‣ 2 What Data is Affected? ‣ Position: Privacy is not just memorization!" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Arbitrary security classifiers can mark to keep your data forever.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S2.SS1.SSS1.Px3" title="In 2.1.1 What is Explicit Consent? The Default Opt-in Setting ‣ 2.1 Data Collection and Retention Policies ‣ 2 What Data is Affected? ‣ Position: Privacy is not just memorization!" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Your conversations persist for years.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S2.SS1.SSS2" title="In 2.1 Data Collection and Retention Policies ‣ 2 What Data is Affected? ‣ Position: Privacy is not just memorization!" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">2.1.2 </span>Do Users Really Have a Choice? Opt-out and Other Limitations</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsubsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S2.SS1.SSS2.Px1" title="In 2.1.2 Do Users Really Have a Choice? Opt-out and Other Limitations ‣ 2.1 Data Collection and Retention Policies ‣ 2 What Data is Affected? ‣ Position: Privacy is not just memorization!" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">“Temporary/vanish Chat” mode still keeps your data for 30 days.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S2.SS1.SSS2.Px2" title="In 2.1.2 Do Users Really Have a Choice? Opt-out and Other Limitations ‣ 2.1 Data Collection and Retention Policies ‣ 2 What Data is Affected? ‣ Position: Privacy is not just memorization!" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Deletion is an option … only on paper and not in practice!</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S2.SS1.SSS2.Px3" title="In 2.1.2 Do Users Really Have a Choice? Opt-out and Other Limitations ‣ 2.1 Data Collection and Retention Policies ‣ 2 What Data is Affected? ‣ Position: Privacy is not just memorization!" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Your paid subscription doesn’t protect you, only enterprise customers get ’perfect’ treatment.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S2.SS1.SSS2.Px4" title="In 2.1.2 Do Users Really Have a Choice? Opt-out and Other Limitations ‣ 2.1 Data Collection and Retention Policies ‣ 2 What Data is Affected? ‣ Position: Privacy is not just memorization!" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Courts can override your privacy settings with a single order—and they already have.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S2.SS1.SSS2.Px5" title="In 2.1.2 Do Users Really Have a Choice? Opt-out and Other Limitations ‣ 2.1 Data Collection and Retention Policies ‣ 2 What Data is Affected? ‣ Position: Privacy is not just memorization!" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Fun features can be data collection honeypots.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
