<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S3" title="In Position: Privacy is not just memorization!" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">3 </span>How is the Data Being Exposed?</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S3.SS1" title="In 3 How is the Data Being Exposed? ‣ Position: Privacy is not just memorization!" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">3.1 </span>Training Data Leakage via Regurgitation</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S3.SS1.SSS1" title="In 3.1 Training Data Leakage via Regurgitation ‣ 3 How is the Data Being Exposed? ‣ Position: Privacy is not just memorization!" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">3.1.1 </span>Verbatim Regurgitation of Pre-training Data is Overrated</span></a></li>
