<div id="S1.I1.i1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S1.I1.i1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">§2.1.1 What is Explicit Consent? The Default Opt-in Setting</p>
</div></li>
