</div></li>
<li id="S1.I1.i2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="S1.I1.i2.I1.i2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="S1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">§2.2.2 System Retrieved Data</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S1.I1.i2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="S1.I1.i2.I1.i3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="S1.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S1.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">§2.2.3 Publicly Available Data</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="S1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S1.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S1.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">§3 How is the Data Being Exposed?</span></p>
<ul id="S1.I2" class="ltx_itemize" style="--ltx-enum-leftmargin:1.5em;">
<li id="S1.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S1.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S1.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">§3.1 Training Data Leakage via Regurgitation</p>
