<div id="S1.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S1.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">§3.4 Privacy Under the Microscope: Indirect Attribute Inference</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S1.I2.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S1.I2.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S1.I2.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">§3.5 Privacy Through the Telescope: Direct Attribute Aggregation</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="S1.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S1.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S1.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">§4 A Decade of AI/ML Privacy Research: Trends from Leading ML, NLP, and S&amp;P Conferences</span></p>
<ul id="S1.I3" class="ltx_itemize" style="--ltx-enum-leftmargin:1.5em;">
<li id="S1.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S1.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
