</div></li>
<li id="S1.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S1.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S1.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">§4.2 Annotation Pipeline</p>
</div></li>
